From: BeagleY-AI Project
Subject: [PATCH] sensor: register OX08D10 with TI DCC profile 8

Map the OX08D10 name to its sensor-specific WDR tuning identifier.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [BeagleY integration]

--- a/src/tiovx_sensor_module.c
+++ b/src/tiovx_sensor_module.c
@@ -457,6 +457,10 @@ vx_status tiovx_init_sensor(SensorObj *sensorObj, char *objName)
     {
         sensorObj->sensorParams.dccId=304;
     }
+    else if(strcmp(sensorObj->sensor_name, "SENSOR_OX08D10") == 0)
+    {
+        sensorObj->sensorParams.dccId=8;
+    }
    else
     {
         TIOVX_MODULE_ERROR("[SENSOR-MODULE] Invalid sensor name\n");
